# Terrain fixture samples are raw little-endian Uint16 grids. They MUST be committed and checked
# out byte-for-byte: with `core.autocrlf=true` a text-ish payload would be rewritten to CRLF on
# checkout and every recorded sha256 in packages/cesium-webgpu/fixtures/**/manifest.json would stop
# matching. Marking the extension binary removes the guesswork (git's content sniffing would
# usually get this right, but "usually" is not a property CI can rely on).
*.hgt binary
